Hi=C2=A0B6,

**Want to learn****how to use Creately through a few easy, beginner-level,=
****tips and tricks=3F****=F0=9F=91=8D=F0=9F=8F=BB=EF=B8=8F**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D

Creately is made for all kinds of individuals and teams as a solution to =
simplify how they get their work done.

And there are plenty of ways to customize it for your need so you can get =
your work done even faster.

=C2=A0

By now you must have familiarized yourself with the basic features of =
Creately. Here we have a round up of our favorite tips that will help you =
further enhance the usage of these basic features and become a Creately pro=
.=C2=A0

**Plus Create**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Plus Create cuts the time you take to add the next shape by half, speeding =
up the visualizing process. Once you add a shape on to your workspace, use =
the plus (+) sign to add the next shape and connector in a single click.

**Universal text search**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=


Search for anything in and across all workspaces in different folders =
instantly. Visually navigate and see the search results. [Read =
more](https://support.creately.com/hc/en-us/articles/360004262755-How-to-se=
arch-for-workspaces-in-and-across-folders-)

**Shape Links**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Use shape links to link between shapes to build navigational structures in =
and across workspaces. Link shapes to external resources such as web pages,=
 or documents with have them opened right within the app with in-app =
previews.

**My Tasks**
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Use My Tasks to keep track of all the tasks, checklist items, & comments =
assigned to you. Click on a task on the My Task panel to navigate to the =
relevant workspace directly.

Learn more neat tips and shortcuts on using Creately [here.=
](https://support.creately.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002882776-Getting-Start=
ed)=C2=A0
=C2=A0

[Open Creately](https://app.creately.com/)

For more information on Creately=E2=80=99s features, click =
[here](https://creately.com/tour/).

=C2=A0

If you have any other questions or concerns, reply to this email and we =
will get back to you soon.

=C2=A0

**The Creately Team.**

